ont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">苹果CEO库克与欧盟磋商，旨在推动新版Siri AI进入欧洲市场</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">X 平台正式推出托管 MCP 服务器，支持 AI 工具直连 API 检索实时数据</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic发布大模型Claude Sonnet 5，性能对标旗舰并大幅下调价格</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌因算力短缺限制Meta访问Gemini模型，促使Meta加速自主研发</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d5b256fb8d19e8a800496f952486380f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">受全球云计算基础设施短缺影响，谷歌已正式限制Meta对其顶级AI模型Gemini的访问权限。此前，Gemini在Meta的诈骗检测及有害内容过滤等自动化安全工作流程中表现优异，性能甚至优于Meta自家的开源Llama系统。此次算力配给限制导致Meta内部多个关键AI项目进度延误，迫使Meta管理层要求团队提升AI Token使用效率。为摆脱对第三方模型平台的依赖，Meta已通过新成立的“超级智能实验室”加速自主研发进程，将核心安全与审核工作负载大规模迁移至其自研模型“Muse Spark”。这一举措标志着Meta在人工智能领域寻求底层技术自主可控的战略转向，反映出在算力资源成为稀缺生产要素的背景下，科技巨头正加速构建独立的基础设施能力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布AI生图模型Nano Banana 2 Lite，实现4秒出图并全面取代旧版</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f70dcd19505d16e86ac5321d58e60cb8.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式发布自研AI图像与视频生成模型Nano Banana 2 Lite，该模型主打高频批量内容生产，核心优势在于超低延迟，仅需4秒即可生成高质量图像。在计费方面，生成一张1K分辨率图像消耗1120个token，费用为0.034美元。目前，该模型已全面上线谷歌AI Studio、Gemini API及Gemini企业级智能体平台，并正式取代初代模型。此外，谷歌扩大了Gemini Omni Flash的开放范围，视频生成收费标准为每秒0.10美元。同时推出的Omni Product Studio应用支持将静态图像一键转化为电商视频，旨在为开发者提供端到端的多媒体创作体验。此次更新旨在通过提升运行速度与降低使用成本，优化专业工作流的图像产出效率。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果CEO库克与欧盟磋商，旨在推动新版Siri AI进入欧洲市场</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8eb4ffbca1e3fd6eebac17f1e14f6761.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果CEO蒂姆·库克近日与欧盟科技事务负责人亨娜·维尔库宁举行视频会谈，就新版Siri AI入欧事宜展开建设性磋商。此前，因未能满足《数字市场法》（DMA）关于互操作性的要求，苹果宣布推迟在欧盟地区的iPhone和iPad上线该功能。新版Siri已转型为可调用个人数据的智能聊天机器人，其能否入欧被视为评估苹果AI竞争力的关键。目前核心分歧在于苹果拒绝向竞争对手开放同等设备数据访问权限，且此前申请的18个月合规宽限期遭欧盟拒绝。苹果曾提出“可信系统代理”方案以保护用户数据，但因缺乏具体运作细节进展缓慢。此次最高层直接对话虽未进入正式合规程序，但被视为双方打破监管僵局、迈向后续合作的重要一步。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">X 平台正式推出托管 MCP 服务器，支持 AI 工具直连 API 检索实时数据</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dcc54ad8b3de337c043be563018164da.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">X 平台于周一正式推出托管模型上下文协议（MCP）服务器，允许 Claude、Cursor、Grok Build 等兼容 MCP 标准的 AI 助手在获得用户授权后，直接与 X API 通信以检索实时数据。该举措简化了开发者的集成路径，无需再自行构建托管服务器或处理复杂的身份验证。X 官方明确表示，该托管 MCP 工具目前不兼容 Write API 端点，即 AI 工具无法通过该服务在 X 上进行自主发布，且此举并未绕过现有的 API v2 规则。目前，X 已通过调整 API 定价策略（如发布帖子 0.015 美元、链接 0.20 美元）来遏制程序化滥用。随着 GitHub、Slack、Notion 等巨头纷纷加入，MCP 正成为连接大模型与外部工具的通用标准。X 此举旨在提升其数据资产在 AI 时代的变现价值</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic发布大模型Claude Sonnet 5，性能对标旗舰并大幅下调价格</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0bc19e8d5c77782b01d62f0e2d95bcf9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic正式发布全新大语言模型Claude Sonnet 5，该模型定位为中高阶产品，旨在显著缩小与旗舰Opus系列之间的性能差距。作为目前“最具代理能力”的Sonnet模型，Claude Sonnet 5在推理、编程及知识型任务中表现优异，支持自主规划复杂任务、自查输出结果，并能灵活调用浏览器与终端等外部工具。在安全性方面，该模型有效降低了幻觉率与讨好式回应，对恶意请求的识别更加智能。目前，Claude Sonnet 5已面向所有套餐开放，并成为免费计划与Pro付费计划的默认模型。Anthropic采取了极具竞争力的定价策略，其每百万输入和输出token的费用远低于Opus模型。通过此次发布，Anthropic旨在通过降维打击的定价模式，降低开发者与普通用户使用顶尖AI自动化能力的门槛，加速推动AI</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
